1
00:00:00,588 --> 00:00:04,048
(Sheldon:)...she arranged for me to be
an Amtrak Junior Conductor for the day.

2
00:00:04,258 --> 00:00:09,058
(Sheldon:)It's usually only open to children.
She got them to make an exception.

3
00:00:09,722 --> 00:00:11,932
(Leonard:)Shame on her.

4
00:00:12,683 --> 00:00:14,853
(Sheldon:)They let me blow the whistle,
Leonard.

5
00:00:15,936 --> 00:00:17,896
(Leonard:)She's good.

6
00:00:18,105 --> 00:00:20,485
l know. And it gets worse.

7
00:00:20,691 --> 00:00:24,571
(Sheldon:)Her efforts are causing me
to have affectionate feelings for her...

8
00:00:24,778 --> 00:00:27,778
(Sheldon:)...at inappropriate times.

9
00:00:29,783 --> 00:00:32,743
(Leonard:)You mean like in bed
or in the shower?

10
00:00:32,953 --> 00:00:37,203
No. And would you please stop
referencing that infernal book?

11
00:00:38,709 --> 00:00:40,379
(Sheldon:)For example, this morning...

12
00:00:40,586 --> 00:00:44,586
...l was calculating the random motion
of virtual particles in a vacuum...

13
00:00:44,798 --> 00:00:51,558
(Sheldon:)...when suddenly, the particles morphed
into an image of Amy's dandruff...

14
00:00:54,475 --> 00:01:01,025
(Sheldon:)...gently cascading down onto her pale,
slightly hunched shoulders.

